  "@es": "Escritura y pronunciación (6): las últimas vocales: oa, uô, ơi, ua, ưa, uôi, ươi",
  "@en": "Writing and pronunciation (6): the last vowels: oa, uô, ơi, ua, ưa, uôi, ươi"
